        <activityName xml:lang="en">Blast furnace</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Blast furnace
Assumptions for medium sized plant. Output: 1'500'000 t/a, life time: 50 years. Site is shared with BOF converter.;
UUID: 7c281d62-c9e7-34a7-bbb3-5c41ebdb3889
Infrastructure for input material unloading and storage, blast furnace processes and casting and for administrative buildings
Location: Some Swiss datasets are used for European processes.
Technology: Assumed technology of medium sized plant.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Internet search 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7c281d62-c9e7-34a7-bbb3-5c41ebdb3889.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
